{"speciesId":684,"names":{"fr":"Sucroquin","es":"Swirlix","en":"Swirlix","ja":"ペロッパフ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il immobilise son adversaire à l’aide de filaments blancs, sucrés et collants qui ressemblent à de la barbe à papa."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Escupe hebras pegajosas de color blanco y textura parecida a la del algodón de azúcar, con las que envuelve al enemigo y le impide que se mueva."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"To entangle its opponents in battle, it extrudes white threads as sweet and sticky as cotton candy."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"わたあめのような 甘くて ベタつく 白い 糸を 出して 相手を 絡め取り 動きを 封じる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se gave de sucreries à longueur de journée, à tel point que sa fourrure finit par ressembler à de la barbe à papa, sucrée et poisseuse."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Como se alimenta exclusivamente de dulces, su pelaje es tan pegajoso y dulzón como el algodón de azúcar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Because it eats nothing but sweets, its fur is as sticky sweet as cotton candy."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"甘いもの ばかりを 食べているので 体毛が わたあめのように 甘く ベタベタしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il immobilise son adversaire à l’aide de filaments blancs, sucrés et collants qui ressemblent à de la barbe à papa."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Escupe hebras pegajosas de color blanco y textura parecida a la del algodón de azúcar, con las que envuelve al enemigo y le impide que se mueva."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"To entangle its opponents in battle, it extrudes white threads as sweet and sticky as cotton candy."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"わたあめのような 甘くて ベタつく 白い 糸を 出して 相手を 絡め取り 動きを 封じる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il se gave de sucreries à longueur de journée, à tel point que sa fourrure finit par ressembler à de la barbe à papa, sucrée et poisseuse."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Como se alimenta exclusivamente de dulces, su pelaje es tan pegajoso y dulzón como el algodón de azúcar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Because it eats nothing but sweets, its fur is as sticky sweet as cotton candy."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"甘いもの ばかりを 食べているので 体毛が わたあめのように 甘く ベタベタしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il mange son propre poids en sucre chaque jour. S’il n’a pas sa dose de sucreries, il devient horriblement grognon."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Ingiere diariamente una cantidad de azúcar equivalente a su peso corporal. De lo contrario, se pone de muy mal humor."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It eats its own weight in sugar every day. If it doesn’t get enough sugar, it becomes incredibly grumpy."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"１日に 食べる 砂糖は 自分の 体重と 同じ。 糖分が 足りないと ひどく 不機嫌になる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa douce fourrure possède une odeur sucrée comme la barbe à papa. Il produit des filaments gluants pour empêtrer ses adversaires."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su esponjoso pelaje desprende un olor dulzón como el del algodón de azúcar. Escupe hebras pegajosas con las que envuelve a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The sweet smell of cotton candy perfumes Swirlix’s fluffy fur. This Pokémon spits out sticky string to tangle up its enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ふわふわの 体毛は 綿飴の ように 甘い におい。 べたつく 糸を 出して 敵を 絡めとる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":684,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"string-shot","learns"